    "Ownerless immutable runtime; the trusted forwarder and XEN address are constructor arguments. Sibling deployments on BNB Chain, Polygon, Avalanche, Optimism, Base and Fantom carry the same code and are campaign legs.",
    "Campaign: every FeesClaimed after the anchor by an account with no own Burn or Staked event on that deployment (fees it could only have obtained through forwarder-credited burns), from Etherscan and Fantom RPC logs; PulseChain's forked copy was not scanned.",
